    "text_blocks": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Yes, standard homeowners insurance policies in Utah typically cover hail damage to your roof, siding, windows, and other insured structures on your property."
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Coverage Details"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Dwelling Protection: Pays to repair or replace your home's exterior and structure damaged by hail."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Other Structures: Covers detached items like fences, sheds, or detached garages."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Personal Belongings: Replaces indoor items if hail breaks a window or punches a hole in the roof, allowing rain to ruin interior furniture or electronics."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Official Guidelines: You can review general claim rules via the Utah Insurance Department . You can also see an overview of general policy applications through GEICO Homeowners Insurance in Utah .",
            "snippet_links": [
              {
                "text": "Utah Insurance Department",
                "link": "https://insurance.utah.gov/consumers/home-insurance/home-claims-info/"
              },
              {
                "text": "GEICO Homeowners Insurance in Utah",
                "link": "https://www.geico.com/homeowners-insurance/states/ut/"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Important Factors to Check"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Separate Deductibles: Many policies apply a specific percentage-based deductible for wind and hail claims rather than a standard flat-dollar deductible."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Cosmetic Exclusions: Some insurers exclude damage that only affects the appearance of materials (like minor metal denting) without affecting their functional integrity."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Filing Deadlines: Utah policies require you to report storm damage promptly\u2014often within a specific window after the weather event occurs."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "If you'd like, tell me:"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "What parts of your home were hit (roof, siding, windows?)"
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Do you know if your policy has a separate percentage deductible for hail?"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "I can help you prepare for the next steps or estimate your potential out-of-pocket costs."
      },
